nder_generation_column","table_cell_id":"hanshu-016-t1-r068-c00","subject_table_cell_id":"hanshu-016-t1-r068-c04","quote":"曲成圉矦蟲達","subject_quote":"孝文元年，矦捷嗣，八年，有罪，免。十亖年，捷復封，十八年，復免。戶九千三百。孝景中五年，矦捷復封，五年薨。","object_mention_id":"hanshu-016-t1-r068-c00-m000","subject_mention_id":"hanshu-016-t1-r068-c04-m001","generation_source_term":"子","generation_distance":1,"work_id":"w-hanshu","book_id":"b-hanshu-016","chapter_id":"table-chapter-hanshu-016","source_id":"table-witness-hanshu-016","source_revision":"2374254"}],"human_reviewed":false,"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依漢表原子／孫／玄孫欄相對始封者的明示層級接合同根；闕代保持空，不由承爵或ID推父子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","person_id":"d7u_bgr_wdi_A"}],"name_components":[{"person_id":"d7u_bgr_wdi_A","title":"曲城侯","surname":"蟲","ming":"捷","additional_names":["犍（顏師古注）"],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p014","quote":"孝景三年，吳楚七國反，吳使者至淮南，淮南王欲發兵應之。其相曰：「大王必欲發兵應吳，臣願為將。」王乃屬相兵。淮南相已將兵，因城守，不聽王而為漢；漢亦使曲城侯將兵救淮南：淮南以故得完。吳使者至廬江，廬江王弗應，而往來使越。吳使者至衡山，衡山王堅守無二心。孝景四年，吳楚已破，衡山王朝，上以為貞信，乃勞苦之曰：「南方卑溼。」徙衡山王王濟北，所以褒之。及薨，遂賜謚為貞王。廬江王邊越，數使使相交，故徙為衡山王，王江北。淮南王如故。","references":[{"title":"《史記集解》卷118·徐廣釋曲城侯","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0002/blob/73c4d2ba067d99a6de924ac952fd6921a958c7e7/KR2a0002_118.txt#L114","source_commit":"73c4d2ba067d99a6de924ac952fd6921a958c7e7","source_blob":"9d2ddd755bfb7f9cca5664cbd23393bc203cb5c9","quote":"使曲城侯(徐廣曰曲城侯姓蟲名/捷其父名逢髙祖功臣)將兵救淮南淮南以¶","verified_extent":{"start_line":1,"end_line":120},"cached_response_sha256":"8bac741b6f2b3b79e7e1271a6dc0a9ec0bef3f8aa5ee8343e91bb71a042765b0","image_verified":false,"quote_format":"kanripo_line_wrapped","display_quote":"使曲城侯(徐廣曰曲城侯姓蟲名捷其父名逢髙祖功臣)將兵救淮南淮南以"},{"title":"《漢書》卷44·晉灼、顏師古釋曲城侯","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0007/blob/683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454/KR2a0007_044.txt","quote":"漢亦使曲城侯將兵救淮南(晉灼曰功臣表蟲達也師/古曰晉説非此蟲逹之子)¶\n<pb:KR2a0007_WYG_044-10a>¶\n(耳名犍逹已先薨○宋祁/曰浙本注文作晉説非也)淮南以故得完吳使者至廬¶","source_commit":"683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454","source_blob":"e2143a58b312e7963377044e56322795ef02b5c4","image_verified":false,"quote_format":"kanripo_line_wrapped","display_quote":"漢亦使曲城侯將兵救淮南(晉灼曰功臣表蟲達也師古曰晉説非此蟲逹之子)(耳名犍逹已先薨○宋祁曰浙本注文作晉説非也)淮南以故得完吳使者至廬"},{"title":"《漢書·髙惠髙后文功臣表》曲成列·子欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2374254&title=漢書/髙惠髙后文功臣表","source_revision":"2374254","quote":"孝文元年，矦捷嗣，八年，有罪，免。十亖年，捷復封，十八年，復免。戶九千三百。孝景中五年，矦捷復封，五年薨。","image_verified":false}],"note":"徐廣明言姓蟲名捷，漢表原子欄亦作捷；顏師古名犍之說保留。爵年與本事有衝突，未以在爵時段推姓名，未改收到正文。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-118","source_id":"s-shiji118-huainan"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m014-0074","start":74,"end":77,"surface":"曲城侯","kind":"person","person_id":"d7u_bgr_wdi_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"徐廣明釋姓蟲名捷，與兩表曲城／曲成列侯捷相互參照；身份暫取直接注說，不以封免年內插證明景三年仍在爵。漢表文十八年復免、景中五年復封與本事有爵年衝突，另存未定；晉灼指達為顏師古所駁，犍字異說保留。","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-hanshu016-qucheng-001","subject_person_id":"d7u_bgr_wdi_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"d7u_bgr_wdi","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"kind":"table_cell","table_id":"hanshu-016","relationship_layout":"founder_generation_column","table_cell_id":"hanshu-016-t1-r068-c00","subject_table_cell_id":"hanshu-016-t1-r068-c04","quote":"曲成圉矦蟲達","subject_quote":"孝文元年，矦捷嗣，八年，有罪，免。十亖年，捷復封，十八年，復免。戶九千三百。孝景中五年，矦捷復封，五年薨。","object_mention_id":"hanshu-016-t1-r068-c00-m000","subject_mention_id":"hanshu-016-t1-r068-c04-m001","generation_source_term":"子","generation_distance":1,"work_id":"w-hanshu","book_id":"b-hanshu-016","chapter_id":"table-chapter-hanshu-016","source_id":"table-witness-hanshu-016","source_revision":"2374254"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子","generation_distance":1},"interpretation_note":"按原表同列世代欄相對始封者記錄；不由繼位補父名，不補闕名中間世代。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[{"id":"shiji-018-t1-r038-c05-m000","start":6,"end":7,